ked too. New sites take effect right away and stay on. Removing one takes a 15 minute wait or your unlock code.\n- On Android, opening a blocked site in a browser shows Ripple's pause screen with the address and how many times you tried today. Typing in the address bar is not blocked; the page is blocked after you press Enter.\n- Tested on Chrome. Edge, Firefox, Samsung Internet, Opera and others are supported based on public information. Built-in browsers from OPPO, Xiaomi, vivo and Huawei, and Quark, UC and QQ Browser, have not been tested on real phones and may not be blocked.\n- Web pages opened inside apps such as WeChat or Douyin may not be blocked, because Ripple cannot read their address.\n- If you add no sites, everything else works as before.\n- This update is for Android only. The iPhone version stays at v0.1.5.\n", "version": "0.1.12", "versionCode": 27, "apkSizeBytes": 9224705, "sha256": "6b79781b3226540a99a36333e80555be656b0c101f1b24f0138c747c6f9da727", "ipaSizeBytes": 7764400, "ipaSha256": "3b7fca162f27b7033e45fe762f59587214bb7cb2c9cd1f4dcf047afb4f472f0f", "iosVersion": "0.1.5", "downloadUrl": "https://ripplefocus.github.io/dl/ripple-v0.1.12.apk", "iosDownloadUrl": "https://ripplefocus.github.io/dl/ripple-v0.1.5.ipa", "mirrors": ["https://ripplefocus.github.io/dl/ripple-v0.1.12.apk", "https://gh-proxy.com/https://github.com/ripplefocus/ripplefocus.github.io/releases/download/v0.1.12/ripple-v0.1.12.apk", "https://github.com/ripplefocus/ripplefocus.github.io/releases/download/v0.1.12/ripple-v0.1.12.apk", "https://github.com/tumingke0/ripple/releases/download/v0.1.12/ripple-v0.1.12.apk"], "iosMirrors": ["https://ripplefocus.github.io/dl/ripple-v0.1.5.ipa", "https://gh-proxy.com/https://github.com/ripplefocus/ripplefocus.github.io/releases/download/v0.1.5/ripple-v0.1.5.ipa", "https://github.com/ripplefocus/ripplefocus.github.io/releases/download/v0.1.5/ripple-v0.1.5.ipa", "https://github.com/tumingke0/ripple/releases/download/v0.1.5/ripple-v0.1.5.ipa"]}